    "source": "Fresh standalone pages using unmodified official Ant Design/React UMD and public TreeSelect props. Actual React elements, bigint, arrays, iterable objects and a pending Promise are retained by identity. No Native code or expected-value correction.",
    "settle": "The shared public driver moves the pointer outside after each action. Three identical complete DOM projections, each separated by two real paint frames and two tasks.",
